Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 06:15:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sidebar): recover fresh completed-card observations
 during slow refresh [daveey]

Preserve annotation single-flight ownership: use a read-only, timestamp-carrying host peek after a bounded display read. Never publish a stale cache or invoke undeclared waiting sources outside the refresh lock. Expired display evidence remains unknown, never synthetic done.

Proof: stale-positive versus completed-host regression; source-only RED; 518 consumer tests passed with 1 skipped; scripts/check all 21 checks passed.
